Google Cloud Tasks.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.680
It's a task queues service
for App Engine Flex and Second

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.640
Generation runtime.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.970
So this is basically a
centralized cloud task

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.890
API that's fully
managed asynchronous.

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:48.670
It allows you to, in essence,
do task execution service

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:51.790
for any application running
anywhere using a standard API.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.380
So it's great for task queues.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.700
And they talk through
that a little bit,

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.033
