that means, what that looks

00:03:57.033 --> 00:03:59.950
like for App Engine, especially
considering if you were

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.740
using task queues in the past.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:04.660
Apparently, this is
really all the stuff

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.540
you would do with task queue
you will do with Cloud Tasks.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.630
So you can check that out.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:08.800
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.841
Worth noting, like, existing
App Engine customers

00:04:10.841 --> 00:04:14.221
